WEBVTT

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:22.240
He...

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:25.210
Arrest warrants?

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.480
What's that about?

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:33.930
Yes, just now, on the news.

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:37.860
Even the barber shop down below, right now...

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:40.760
Mugiyama? What about Mugiyama?

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:47.380
No way!

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:49.310
What's up? There's something else?

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:54.480
Hey! Hey, c'mon!

00:00:57.550 --> 00:00:58.880
You're lucky.

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:11.860
Asami? Hello? Asami?

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:20.110
<i>Norikonda sabaibaru cousutaa</i>

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:20.080
The survival roller coaster we got on

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.850
There's no need to give up,
run by the highway

00:01:20.110 --> 00:01:22.550
<i>Akirame muyoude run by the highway</i>

00:01:22.550 --> 00:01:24.420
<i>Kimiwa inochi karagara</i>

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:24.620
You just barely escaped with your life

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:26.950
<i>Atashitachimo nodoga karakara</i>

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:27.220
We're thirsty

00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:29.150
<i>Kyokugento mugendai</i>

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:29.360
Extremities and infinity

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:31.490
<i>Tomo ni sorette mugendai</i>

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:31.720
Together, they form a fantasy

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:33.390
<i>Kamaeta me hibana chiri</i>

00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:33.590
The eyes, squaring away, are
throwing out sparks

00:01:33.390 --> 00:01:36.420
<i>Oni-san kochira to shita o dasu</i>

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:36.650
"You're it! This way, " you say,
as you stick your tongue out

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:38.650
<i>Wink</i>

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:38.720
Wink

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:42.330
<i>Kyouretsuna itamini kansha</i>

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:42.540
Grateful for the excruciating pain

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:44.670
<i>Power to iu na no rei de henkan</i>

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:44.970
I'm restored by a gratitude
known as power

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:50.580
<i>Mou sorosoro okaeri asobareta houga
iinodewa naide shouka</i>

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:50.780
Perhaps it would be better too return soon?

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:59.480
<i>Matsugeno sukima umeruyouni aimeiku</i>

00:01:50.780 --> 00:01:59.720
As though filling in the gaps between
the eyelashes, eye make

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:06.790
<i>Kokorono sukima umeruyouni I take</i>

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:06.990
As though filling in the gaps of
my heart, I take

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:11.260
<i>Gekiretsu panchide gyakuni takamaru</i>

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:11.460
On the contrary, the intensity is heightened
by a powerful punch

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:15.730
<i>Yabai shiuchi hodo yokei moechauwa</i>

00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:15.800
The worse I'm treated, the more I get fired up

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:20.100
<i>Mouretsu panchide atashi takaburu</i>

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:20.240
I get worked up over an intense punch

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:28.530
<i>Sonna koto shite kurete arigatou</i>

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:29.080
Thank you for doing such a thing

00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:31.050
<i>Sukima sukima sukimani mimai</i>

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:31.250
A gap, a gap, pay a sympathy visit

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.050
<i>Janai janai itainjanai?</i>

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:33.220
Doesn't it, doesn't it, doesn't it hurt?

00:02:33.050 --> 00:02:34.720
<i>Mimai tsurai? ltai? Yabai?</i>

00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:34.990
Is the visit painful? Does it hurt?
Is it dangerous?

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:39.350
<i>lkitai itai shitai, lkitai itai shitai</i>

00:02:34.990 --> 00:02:39.660
I want to go, I want to stay, I want to do it

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:49.830
<i>Shell of Destruction</i>

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:45.660
Mikura! Mikura!

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:48.700
There's no sign of her over here either.

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:50.320
Did she really fall?

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:52.530
I'm positive.

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:54.800
She might have got caught on a part
of the building on her way down.

00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:00.770
I'll take a look inside the building.

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:03.300
You go back to the agency, Mr. Kurokawa.

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:05.550
I'm getting worried about Asami.

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:07.280
But you're...

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:11.850
It looks pretty nasty, but the injury
itself is no big deal.

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:15.850
I'll be right back, so don't bite off more than
you can chew. Just sit back and wait.

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:18.590
I'm not Mikura.

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:29.440
Not good. I'm starting to feel sick.

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:32.730
Damn, this is nothing.

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:39.370
Mikura... Don't die...

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:42.540
<i>Caution</i>

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:53.250
It's deserted.

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:56.030
There might be a hidden room.

00:03:56.030 --> 00:03:58.560
Just in case, check all the rooms!

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:11.750
Someone's here!

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:14.450
Chief, that's a robot.

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:16.470
How misleading! What the hell?!

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:31.230
Miss Mikura...

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:35.270
What is it?!

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:37.470
Say what?!

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:38.840
Which way did he run?

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:39.980
I don't know!

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:41.280
<i>Nebukuro</i>

00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:41.830
Mugiyama escaped while in transit!

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:45.440
He took an officer hostage
and is currently on the run!

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:48.440
Please don't kill me.

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:53.350
How nice and earnest policemen are these days.

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:58.590
But I doubt they'll let me through
without putting up some resistance.

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:00.930
Let's see...

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:04.830
That damned barber!
Hurry and cordon off the area!

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:06.740
What should we do about here?

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:09.970
Leave two or three men behind!
Now's not the time for this!

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:14.030
I wonder if everyone's all right?

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:26.780
I've still got a lot to learn.

00:05:31.730 --> 00:05:34.860
He's got some connections
within police organizations,

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:37.020
which is why I didn't ask you guys
in the first place.

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:41.670
I shouldn't have depended on that thug after all.

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:43.660
What a waste of money!

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:47.210
He fought back with his gun, so we had
no choice but to kill him.

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:49.180
That's the story, right?

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:54.780
I'm counting on you, Inspector Akudoh,
Assistant Inspector Kose.

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:57.650
Well, as long as we get paid.

00:06:12.770 --> 00:06:13.970
Aya...

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:17.600
I'll make anyone who knows
about you disappear.

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:23.800
<i>Mugi-ya</i>

00:06:32.690 --> 00:06:35.180
This certainly doesn't look good.

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:36.990
Asami?!

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:38.890
Mr. Kurokawa!

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:41.560
Great, you're still safe. Where are you now?

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.030
Mr. Harada's work room.

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:45.330
Seriously?

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:49.860
I managed to hide somehow,
but there are policemen outside.

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:54.570
Gotcha. From now on, you need to do
what I tell you. Okay?

00:06:57.410 --> 00:06:58.480
Yeah...

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.110
Does she understand?

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:02.740
Here...

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:05.020
That's it!

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:08.050
You're Akudoh, from headquarters?

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:10.720
You're Kurokawa, right?

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:17.000
The fact you've shown up means
Omabari must be desperate.

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:18.830
Nothing personal.

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:26.310
Damn!

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:29.800
Hello?! Hello?!

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:33.540
Run!

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:37.020
Hey, don't run! Open fire!

00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:38.520
How are things?

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:40.090
I found it!

00:07:40.090 --> 00:07:41.920
Hurry, Asami!

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:43.520
Yes, Sir!

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:45.250
Do your best, Asami!

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:56.270
Get in! Get in!

00:07:56.270 --> 00:07:57.530
Mr. Kurokawa!

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:01.000
Not good.

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:11.650
The building...

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:14.090
It was set up for when the enemy
surrounded the place.

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:15.520
I didn't think that would ever happen,

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:18.520
so we were half-kidding when
we set it up. Sheesh...

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:22.160
In addition, the agency was only
supposed to blow up a little bit.

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:24.070
That building was a lot weaker
than I thought, structurally.

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:28.170
Hey, you, building! Do something!
You're jingle building for Christmas!

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:30.400
Say something! What, nothing to say?

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:45.610
Awake? You're tough.

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:49.090
Why are you here?

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:50.920
Well, I couldn't just leave you here.

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:53.090
Could I borrow something?

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:54.560
What?

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:58.400
Do you have a cell phone?
Mine got lost somewhere.

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.230
I have to call an ambulance.

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:01.940
What? You don't have one?

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:04.200
Mind your own business. I...

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:06.970
I can't forgive you for targeting Pops,

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:09.970
but I do have to repay you for saving me.

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:13.440
lngrates don't hang around
long enough to eat dinner.

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:15.650
There it is.

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:18.280
I have to contact Pops too.

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:25.720
Who's there?

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:29.430
Police.

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:33.260
There was a report of gunfire in this area.

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:34.790
Police?

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:37.590
Yes.

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:43.870
I've located a DSA member,
for whom an arrest warrant has been issued.

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:48.170
An arrest warrant?
What's that supposed to mean?

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:52.010
No!

00:09:55.460 --> 00:09:57.750
Ouch!

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:00.390
Why?

00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:05.990
I'm going to do as I please.

00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:08.240
That's all.

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:10.070
What's your name?

00:10:10.070 --> 00:10:12.110
Kazuto...

00:10:12.110 --> 00:10:15.080
Hey, wait a minute. Get a hold of yourself! Hey!

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:20.950
It hurts. This hurts too much...

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:39.600
Looks like I got here in the nick of time.

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:42.360
Pops!

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:50.170
So it's Kose. So he was here after all.

00:10:50.950 --> 00:10:52.710
He said he was police, but...

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:54.070
So it's true!

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:57.320
Yeah, he's Assistant Inspector Kose
from headquarters,

00:10:57.320 --> 00:11:03.590
and he and his superior, Inspector Akudoh,
are a really evil bunch.

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:06.830
If it's for money, he'll do anything,
he'll do anything illegal.

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:10.730
They're dirty cops, a dirty cop on top of
a dirty cop, and they get carried away.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:15.430
So, why is this handsome assassin
with you, anyway?

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:21.180
I don't know either. All I learned is
that his name is Kazuto.

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:21.980
Kazuto...

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:23.510
Mr. Kurokawa!

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:25.480
Asami? Asami's here too?

00:11:26.510 --> 00:11:28.080
A lot happened on our end too.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:30.810
Mr. Harada! It's Mr. Harada!

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:39.220
It's all right. He's not dead yet.

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:42.230
Get a hold of yourself. Hey, Harada!

00:11:42.230 --> 00:11:43.700
Mr. Harada...

00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:06.850
My parents are overseas for the rest
of this month with work.

00:12:07.290 --> 00:12:10.420
Thanks. We really appreciate this, Asami.

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:13.720
Oh, no. You're my friends.

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:17.400
The rest will be up to his physical endurance.

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:19.930
The best thing to do is
to get a blood transfusion,

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:22.160
but we can't go to the hospital now.

00:12:22.270 --> 00:12:23.970
Arrest warrants out for us...

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:25.110
Damn it!

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:28.810
Maybe there's no real tomorrow for us unless
we put the squeeze on them from the root.

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:30.040
The root?

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:34.540
We'll show you who the real villains are,
Mr. Police Chief.

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:37.050
Say what?!

00:12:37.050 --> 00:12:38.820
I didn't think Kose would end up like that.

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:41.990
You make me pay a lot of money,
shoot your mouth off,

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:44.550
and get offed instead?! You idiots!

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:49.760
Not only did I trump up charges against them,
but I called you guys in!

00:12:49.760 --> 00:12:53.430
If Kurokawa is allowed to live,
then my position is lost!

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:56.340
If he gets pissed off and spreads
a scandal about me...

00:12:57.340 --> 00:12:59.340
Just the thought of it is frightening!

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:01.480
Find him and be sure to kill him!

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:02.940
You don't need to tell me.

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:06.310
I'll be avenging my precious subordinate.

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:14.250
Thank you very much.

00:13:18.490 --> 00:13:20.460
Thank you very much.

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:28.870
Thank you very much.

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:33.210
Chief, it's about the DSA,
who we have a warrant out for.

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:36.380
Shut up! I left that in the hands of
Akudoh from headquarters!

00:13:36.380 --> 00:13:38.440
More importantly, don't neglect
your guard duties at the venue!

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:41.820
I got an e-mail saying the venue
was going to be blown up,

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:44.410
though I think this is just some weird stalker.

00:13:47.690 --> 00:13:51.520
I need to show my real skills to Aya here.

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:07.640
Thank you very much.

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:09.270
Press button. Press.

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:14.040
No! Oh, you...

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:16.680
Hey, what's that?

00:14:19.590 --> 00:14:21.110
That tickles!

00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:24.690
Thank you very much.

00:14:25.930 --> 00:14:27.530
Two, eight, two, eight.

00:14:27.530 --> 00:14:28.790
Smile, smile!

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:34.600
That bastard!

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.260
Oh, Aya...

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:43.370
Stop it! Stop that video!

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:46.480
Why?

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:48.710
The curtain! Close the curtain!

00:14:54.190 --> 00:14:55.820
Hey, it's that old man!

00:14:55.820 --> 00:14:57.260
For real?!

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:06.000
What's going on?

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.130
Chief, what's the meaning of this?

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:10.690
Well, even I don't...

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:14.470
You said everything would definitely be all right!

00:15:14.840 --> 00:15:16.240
You gotta be kidding me!

00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:21.850
My trump card... I didn't want to
use it like this though.

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:24.090
Kurokawa!

00:15:24.090 --> 00:15:26.140
Since we owe you, you'll get
what's coming to you.

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:28.610
Bastards!

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:31.690
But it's your fault, isn't it?

00:15:31.690 --> 00:15:33.660
I mean, I wanted to be friends with you.

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:35.760
I won't forgive you!

00:15:36.230 --> 00:15:38.100
Somebody! Apprehend those two!

00:15:38.230 --> 00:15:42.170
No one's around, so let's do something like this.

00:15:41.600 --> 00:15:42.570
What?

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:44.090
I'm going to arrest you!

00:15:45.510 --> 00:15:46.910
What's with this old man?!

00:15:46.910 --> 00:15:48.410
How dare you do that to my Aya?!

00:15:48.410 --> 00:15:49.580
You bastard!

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:50.770
Let's kill him.

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:59.650
Hey! I'm a police chief!
You won't get away with this!

00:15:59.650 --> 00:16:00.960
Police chief, you say?

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:02.620
My ass!

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:08.060
Have a little taste of hell for a while.
This isn't the end of it.

00:16:08.060 --> 00:16:10.500
Say, are you seriously going to hack
into a TV station too?

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:12.630
When we do things, it's best to be thorough.

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:14.900
Pops!

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:17.970
Is it Akudoh?

00:16:17.970 --> 00:16:22.540
You're good. Your variety show isn't bad at all.

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:25.240
Not that we're happy to hear praise from you.

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:27.010
Pops!

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:29.040
Mikura, play nice, okay?

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:32.710
This is to avenge Kose.

00:16:50.300 --> 00:16:53.300
This guy is for real.

00:16:56.380 --> 00:16:57.940
We'll make a break for it, Mikura.

00:17:00.010 --> 00:17:01.620
Hurry, Mikura!

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:03.380
Pops, why aren't you firing?

00:17:10.020 --> 00:17:12.290
You're all under arrest!

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:17.900
There, there. Stand back now.

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:20.590
I'll punish him the rest of the way for you.

00:17:22.800 --> 00:17:24.170
This is an announcement.

00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:28.270
There has been a report of crazed felons
on the lam having forced their way in.

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:32.350
Please follow the instructions
of officals and evacate.

00:17:29.040 --> 00:17:31.050
They're trying to isolate us?

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:36.650
In addition, please be careful not to forget
any of your belongings while you do so.

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:39.850
Thank you for coming today.

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:42.910
Let's get out of here too.

00:17:46.130 --> 00:17:47.060
Pops!

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:54.990
Just seal off all the exits! That's all.
I'll take care of the rest.

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:58.770
Now you're just rabbits on a hunting ground.

00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:02.840
Damn, at a time like this...

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:04.350
I've still got a lot to learn.

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:08.180
For now, you have to mend your wounds.
Open wide.

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:11.780
But will those two be all right on their own?

00:18:12.220 --> 00:18:14.740
I'm sure those two will be fine.

00:18:16.220 --> 00:18:18.730
You say that with a lot of confidence.

00:18:18.730 --> 00:18:20.250
They're my friends.

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:23.160
Well, I guess all we can do is believe in them.

00:18:23.630 --> 00:18:24.620
Right!

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:36.180
They've really tightened up the security here.

00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:40.140
The problem is with Akudoh.
He really plans on killing us.

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:43.120
It doesn't seem like he intends to arrest us.

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:46.050
I don't mind having noodles for dinner tonight.

00:18:46.420 --> 00:18:48.410
Looks like we're having hassles
tonight instead. Okay!

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:01.990
Those guys!

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:29.950
Let your guard down, and you won't
live long enough to eat dinner.

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:31.820
Bastard!

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:37.860
This is really bad!

00:19:40.810 --> 00:19:42.710
Which one reverses it?

00:19:43.980 --> 00:19:46.170
Go eat dinner in the afterlife.

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:49.040
Which one?

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:51.950
Die!

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:52.980
Mikura!

00:19:57.090 --> 00:19:58.580
Bite the dust!

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:19.070
Thanks, Pops!

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:25.480
I have to hand it to you, Mikura.
I'm glad I got you to be on my side.

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:29.660
Chief, are you injured?

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:31.060
Can't you tell by looking at me?!

00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:34.090
Damn! They left me behind.
Where did everyone go?

00:20:34.090 --> 00:20:36.360
They're likely after the wanted individuals.

00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:40.270
And they just left me, the police chief, alone?
That can't be.

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:43.700
No, they were here until just a moment ago.

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:46.900
What's going on?

00:20:52.210 --> 00:20:53.200
Bastard!

00:20:54.320 --> 00:20:58.410
Chief, you've gone too far.

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:02.320
Stop it! I'm a public servant!

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:07.900
I'm sick of your seal-like face.
I'll return you to the ocean.

00:21:07.900 --> 00:21:10.060
The cold ocean...

00:21:17.470 --> 00:21:18.700
You understand, right?

00:21:19.240 --> 00:21:22.410
I'm saying we want some support
with our allowance.

00:21:22.410 --> 00:21:24.340
We always go through this.

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:26.880
What's with that look in your eyes?

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:27.780
No.

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:32.950
Come on, Asami. Say that again.
I didn't hear you.

00:21:33.490 --> 00:21:36.180
Are you going against what we're telling you?

00:21:39.630 --> 00:21:40.620
Why, you...

00:21:41.560 --> 00:21:43.120
You wanna get hurt?!

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:46.400
What do you mean, get hurt?

00:21:50.170 --> 00:21:54.130
Make fun of me, and you won't
live long enough to eat dinner!

00:21:57.210 --> 00:21:59.710
<i>Mugi-ya</i>

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:02.680
This place was closed for a while,
so it was a little inconvenient.

00:22:02.680 --> 00:22:05.910
Oh, I'm sorry. We were a little busy.

00:22:19.030 --> 00:22:20.800
Which? This? Hot!

00:22:20.800 --> 00:22:22.270
Hey, it's ready!

00:22:23.700 --> 00:22:25.170
Udon noodles again.

00:22:25.170 --> 00:22:28.340
What are you saying?
These are genuine Sanuki noodles.

00:22:33.710 --> 00:22:36.440
When can we rebuild the agency?

00:22:37.480 --> 00:22:40.420
Well, having some peace like this isn't bad.

00:22:40.850 --> 00:22:43.420
We've been coming close to our lives
coming to an end lately.

00:22:43.420 --> 00:22:46.330
But I don't want to freeze to death!

00:22:56.970 --> 00:22:58.160
Here they come!

00:22:58.940 --> 00:23:00.200
Mr. Kurokawa...

00:23:02.240 --> 00:23:04.910
Dangerous job? Mikura? Why? Hello?

00:23:04.910 --> 00:23:07.010
We're in the business of dangerous activities.

00:23:07.010 --> 00:23:09.280
If we're afraid, we won't live
long enough to eat dinner.

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:10.250
<i>Shell of Destruction</i>

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:20.790
<i>Jyareau konyano aabento wa</i>

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:20.650
Playing around, tonight's evening
concert will be

00:23:20.650 --> 00:23:25.330
The aridness of nature which lurks
in the warmth

00:23:20.790 --> 00:23:25.530
<i>Nukumorini hisomu yaseino kawaki</i>

00:23:25.330 --> 00:23:26.530
OH- AH-

00:23:25.530 --> 00:23:26.700
<i>OH-AH-</i>

00:23:26.530 --> 00:23:31.500
If there's too much nutrition

00:23:26.700 --> 00:23:31.600
<i>Hitsuyouna youbunwa takusan arisugiruto</i>

00:23:31.500 --> 00:23:35.470
They become divided based on
how sweet it is

00:23:31.600 --> 00:23:35.510
<i>Amasagotoni wakerareru</i>

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:42.740
Absentmindedly, touching, the beginning

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:42.950
<i>Bonyari, tezawari, hajimari</i>

00:23:42.740 --> 00:23:47.850
What's the deal with immediately giving me

00:23:42.950 --> 00:23:47.880
<i>Nandakano kankaku no ai dake</i>

00:23:47.850 --> 00:23:52.520
The kind of love which only has a
certain kind of feeling?

00:23:47.880 --> 00:23:52.690
<i>Sugu kurerunotte, dounano?</i>

00:23:52.520 --> 00:23:57.260
The more bitter the repelled honey is

00:23:52.690 --> 00:23:57.390
<i>Hajikareta nigai mitsu hodo</i>

00:23:57.260 --> 00:24:06.130
Perhaps it's that much better

00:23:57.390 --> 00:24:06.360
<i>Moshikashitara sugoku iikamo shirenai</i>

